<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Saroj Learning</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f7fc;
      color: #333;
    }
    .email-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #4A90E2;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .content h2 {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 22px;
    }
    .content p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #555;
    }
    .activation-button {
      background-color: #4A90E2;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f1f1f1;
      color: #777;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #4A90E2;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to Saroj Learning, <%= user.name %></h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Activation Code: <%= activationCode %>!</h2>
      <p>Thank you for joining the Saroj Learning family! We’re thrilled to have you on board, and we can’t wait to see you explore our platform and unlock a world of knowledge.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Section -->
    <div class="footer">
      <p>If you didn’t sign up for Saroj Learning, please ignore this email or <a href="mailto:sarojpanthi2062@gmail.com">contact our support team</a> for assistance.</p>
      <p>&copy; 2025 Saroj Learning. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
